{"path":"/documentation/modeling/huggingface","section":"documentation","title":"huggingface","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight.modeling.huggingface","label":"huggingface","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.logger","label":"logger\n\n\n  \n      module-attribute","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.HUB_TIMEOUT_SECONDS","label":"HUB_TIMEOUT_SECONDS\n\n\n  \n      module-attribute","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.CheckpointUnreachable","label":"CheckpointUnreachable","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.HuggingFaceModel","label":"HuggingFaceModel","depth":3}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">huggingface</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.logger\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">logger</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-module-attribute\"><code>module-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"logger = logging.getLogger('nnsight')"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.HUB_TIMEOUT_SECONDS\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">HUB_TIMEOUT_SECONDS</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-module-attribute\"><code>module-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"HUB_TIMEOUT_SECONDS = 10.0"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-object doc-class\">\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.CheckpointUnreachable\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">CheckpointUnreachable</span>\n\n\n</h3>\n\n\n    <div class=\"doc-contents\">\n            <p class=\"doc-class-bases\">\n              Bases: <code><span title=\"Exception\">Exception</span></code></p>\n\n\n\n        <p>The checkpoint could not be read — the Hub was slow, down, or refused.</p>\n<p>Distinct from <em>reading it and finding nothing</em>, which every reader here\nreports as <code>None</code>. Collapsing the two is how a network problem comes to\nlook like a fact about a model: a config that failed to download makes\n<code>max_tp_size</code> return <code>None</code>, and <code>None</code> is the answer meaning \"this\nmodel cannot be split at all\", so a perfectly shardable model gets placed\nacross cards layer-by-layer and nothing says why.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.HuggingFaceModel\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">HuggingFaceModel</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"HuggingFaceModel(repo_id: Any, *args: Any, revision: Optional[str] = None, **kwargs: Any)"},{"type":"html","html":"<p class=\"doc-class-bases\">\n              Bases: <code><a title=\"            Remotable (nnsight.modeling.mixins.remotable.Remotable)\" href=\"/documentation/modeling/mixins/remotable#nnsight.modeling.mixins.remotable.Remotable\">Remotable</a></code></p>\n\n\n\n        <p>nnsight wrapper around a HuggingFace Hub model.</p>\n<p>Builds the architecture on the meta device from the repo's config and loads\nreal weights on dispatch, both via transformers. The transformers auto class\nis configurable through <code>AUTO_CLASS</code> so subclasses can target, e.g.,\n<code>AutoModelForCausalLM</code>.</p>\n\n\n<table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th><span class=\"doc-section-title\">PARAMETER</span></th>\n          <th><span>DESCRIPTION</span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>repo_id</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>A HuggingFace repo id (e.g. \"openai-community/gpt2\") or an\nalready-loaded torch.nn.Module.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Any\">Any</span></code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"doc-section-item\">\n            <td>\n                <code>revision</code>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"doc-param-details\">\n              <div class=\"doc-md-description\">\n                <p>Optional git revision (branch/tag/commit) of the repo.</p>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-annotation\">\n                    <b>TYPE:</b>\n                      <code><span title=\"typing.Optional\">Optional</span>[<span title=\"str\">str</span>]</code>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"doc-param-default\">\n                    <b>DEFAULT:</b>\n                      <code>None</code>\n                  </span>\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.HuggingFaceModel.AUTO_CLASS\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">AUTO_CLASS</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-class-attribute\"><code>class-attribute</code></small>\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"AUTO_CLASS = 'AutoModel'"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.HuggingFaceModel.repo_id\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">repo_id</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"repo_id = repo_id if isinstance(repo_id, str) else getattr(repo_id, 'name_or_path', None)"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.modeling.huggingface.HuggingFaceModel.revision\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">revision</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-instance-attribute\"><code>instance-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"revision = revision"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"}]}